WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.810
<i>East China Sea
Shanghai Evacuation Fleet</i>

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.020
It's the Xi!

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.170
Over here! Quick!

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.630
Shit!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.590
It's the Xi!

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:11.500
Kei! What are you doing? 
We need to get out of here!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.460
Yeah, this ship isn't going 
to last for much longer.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.170
Let's go, Kei! Don't worry.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.890
I'll protect you, no matter what happens.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.130
Right.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.880
The Air Force is here!

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:39.940
Get them!

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.630
<i>That... won't work!</i>

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:20.310
Kei!

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.530
It's awakened.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.180
EGG pattern within acceptable ranges.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.280
All systems go.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.250
Hey!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.220
<i>What's wrong, you defective girl?</i>

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.660
I want to fly.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.610
No! Don't!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.970
Did that thing shoot down a Xi?

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.340
Wow...

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.680
You're not going to save them?

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:40.280
Kei?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.790
The pilot's still inside!

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.150
Kei!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:49.970
Kei!

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.400
The Rising Sun?

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.180
Hey, are you inside?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.200
There's a rescue boat here!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.290
Get out of there! The plane's going to sink!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.000
H-Hey...

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.200
I'm not here to hurt you—

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.050
Nova Era...

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.770
What the?!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:48.910
Hey, wake up!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.960
<i>Crimson Wings</i>

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.090
Huh?

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.630
Ow...

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:32.520
Huh? Where am I?

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.600
That's right.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.930
This is my grandpa's place in Komatsu.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.540
It wasn't a dream, was it?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:52.240
<i>A Japanese fighter crashed in 
Chinese territorial waters.</i>

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.310
<i>I went to save the pilot, 
and it was a young girl.</i>

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:55.650
<i>And she kissed me.</i>

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:57.560
<i>That's impossible.</i>

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.810
<i>So I haven't told anybody.</i>

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.110
Kei, when are you going to get up?

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.650
M-Minghua?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.090
Don't you know how to knock?

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:09.670
I've seen you in your 
underwear plenty of times.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.410
There's no point in being embarrassed now.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.320
It's not like when we were kids!

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.770
What if it were the other way around?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.750
What if I walked in when you were changing?

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.690
I'd get mad.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.220
That's not fair!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:24.690
Here's the shopping list.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.690
Carrots
Onions
Pork
Lettuce

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.470
This is for lunch, so go now!

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.820
Hurry up!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.370
Why are you bossing me around? 
This isn't even your house.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.290
Mommy, buy me some gummies.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.790
Lessie's all grown up now, huh?

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:42.420
Yup!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.110
I can't believe this.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:45.620
Is this guy even beatable?

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:53.700
That's right.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.220
There are still civilian 
planes in the sky here.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.850
<b>Narutani</b>

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.930
<i>More and more refugees from the 
continent are arriving daily.</i>

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.930
<b>What Do They Want!?
 Mysterious Military Group:
The Xi</b>

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.950
<i>Overcoming cultural 
differences and difficulties</i>

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.480
Thanks for the food.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.500
Sure. Just put that there.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.940
<i>with the locals has become 
a pressing issue.</i>

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.690
<b>What Do They Want!?
 Mysterious Military Group:
The Xi</b>

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.700
<i>What are the authorities doing, 
letting these Xi continue to...</i>

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.170
They're saying the Xi are 
just an "armed group."

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.350
Japan's so peaceful.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.330
What's wrong with that?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.770
It beats running for your life every day.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:23.860
But...

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.990
I like this city.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:28.200
The breeze is so nice and tranquil.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.590
It's the first time in ages I've 
really been able to sleep.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.310
Sure, but...

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.590
I'm going to keep cleaning.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.270
You go water the garden.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.000
Don't you think you're overdoing it?

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.660
Grandpa said you don't 
need to do all this, right?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.610
I'm freeloading here, you know?

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:49.440
And if I'm not busy, I'm going 
to start thinking about things.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.310
I see.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:52.690
Minghua!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.170
Dad!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.040
Minghua!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.490
Your parents will show up on the next 
evacuation ship. I'm sure of it.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.710
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.810
Yup. They'll get rid of the Xi eventually.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:09.910
And once they're gone,
we can go back to China.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:12.360
Kei?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.930
<b>"JASDF deployment"

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.260
<b>"JASDF deployment"

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:34.440
<b>"JSDF Fighter Jets"

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:33.110
I was sure that red fighter was Japanese.

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.970
I didn't dream it, did I?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:41.020
If I could pilot one of those things,
 I could take down the Xi.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.400
I could avenge my mom!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.120
Kei!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.280
We need to talk.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:50.820
What is it?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.420
<b>Air Force Academy Handbook</b>

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.430
What's this about joining 
the JSDF Air Force Academy?

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:57.140
It's just what it looks like.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:01.610
You can train to be a pilot at an 
academy in Yamaguchi Prefecture.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.040
You don't need to pay for 
the dorm or tuition.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.890
You even get a salary.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.140
It's a pretty sweet deal, right?

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:11.850
So what if tuition's free?

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.560
You understand, right?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.080
If I took advantage of that,

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.440
even somebody like me could become a pilot.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.170
Idiot.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.700
Why are you calling me an idiot?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.140
Because you're an idiot.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:22.680
A Self-Defense Force school?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.980
That means you'd be a soldier, right?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.360
You're going to fly a 
plane and fight the Xi?

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.250
Do you <i>want</i> to get killed?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.410
I'm not going to die!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.750
You saw it when we escaped 
from Shanghai, right?

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.480
That red fighter jet.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.520
Nobody's ever been able 
to shoot down the Xi,

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.240
but it was mowing them 
down like it was nothing!

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.870
I'm pretty sure it's a secret JSDF weapon!

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:43.230
But the "secret weapon" you're 
talking about crashed.

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.710
You'll never make it as a pilot.

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:50.570
You've never even been able 
to beat me at arm wrestling.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.320
That was years ago.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.170
I won at racing, the long jump,

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.410
and even the vision exam, too.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.410
This is the fastest way!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:01.690
I'm going to be a JSDF pilot 
and fly in that jet.

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.540
I said no, and I meant it.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.940
I'm telling your grandparents.

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:09.910
I'll tell them that you've got a dumb idea 
in your head, and they should stop you.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.410
Hey! Where are you going, Kei?

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.900
<i>Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!</i>

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:30.180
<b>JASDF fighter jets</b>

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:27.180
<b>De</b>

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:27.390
<b>Del</b>

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.310
<b>Delta</b>

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:28.930
<b>Delta Wing</b>

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:29.180
<b>Delta Wing Cana</b>

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:29.430
<b>Delta Wing Canar</b>

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.060
<b>Delta Wing Canard</b>

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:35.520
<b>Brazil's up and coming fighter jets - photographer.com

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.730
This is it.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.050
The JAS39...

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.690
Gripen.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.760
A Swedish fighter?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:45.860
<b>JAS39 Gripen Swedish Saab Corporation...</b>

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:44.520
Why did a Swedish fighter have 
a Rising Sun emblem on it?

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:51.880
<i>I was sure if I joined the JASDF,
 I could fly one of those.</i>

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.010
<i>Maybe I was wrong.</i>

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.600
What's that huge plane?

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.330
Its wingspan is enormous.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.540
Don't tell me!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:12.840
That's...

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.470
Damn it!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:40.880
<b>How about we stay to the end and see how it goes?</b>

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:40.880
<b>Got it.</b>

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:40.880
<b>Minghua
Where are you? Dinner's ready.</b>

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.350
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.290
<i>Dinner's ready.</i>

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:48.970
<b>Jonanmachi</b>

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:49.760
<b>Mae River</b>

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.060
<b>JASDF/Komatsu Military Base</b>

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:55.520
That's... a JASDF base?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.520
<b>JASDF/Komatsu Military Base</b>

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.290
Komatsu Base?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:05.190
<b>Nakamachi Community Center</b>

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.520
I can't see inside?

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:29.240
But I can't give up after coming this far!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.660
Is there any place that'll let me see inside?

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.270
<b>Current Location</b>

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:41.270
I'm at the edge of the base already!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:52.280
Damn it! I can't see a thing from here!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.950
M-Minghua?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.990
What the hell are you doing out here?

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:01.570
Wh-What...?

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.460
The way you just ran off, and this late...

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.710
I followed you because I 
wondered what you were doing.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.870
What the hell are you doing 
going to a JSDF base?

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.730
It's none of your business, Minghua.

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:12.660
It is!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:13.220
Why?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.150
I'm worried about you!

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:17.430
If I'm not watching, you do 
all kinds of crazy things.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.380
Listen, can you knock that stuff off?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.930
What do you mean, "that stuff"?

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:26.530
Acting like you're my mom. 
Telling me what to do all the time!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.910
I'm not going to be a kid forever!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:31.980
Just leave me alone!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:32.960
I can't!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:34.410
You can't?

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.390
I'm worried because I think you need me!

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:42.360
It doesn't matter whether we're in 
China, Japan, or at the North Pole!

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.240
You're being weird.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.620
You're the one who's being weird.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.350
I'm normal.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:48.820
Now let's go.

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:50.440
We can talk when we're back home.

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:51.960
Knock it off!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.500
What's gotten into you?

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.110
Even if my parents asked you to 
look after me a long time ago,

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.680
you don't have to be so stubborn!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.440
That was when we were kids!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.090
That's not why!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:08.240
You're the only person in this 
country I know right now.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.440
I was separated from 
all my friends and family.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:14.980
You're all I have left,
 and you want to join the army?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.230
Am I not allowed to worry?

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.470
Is that just me being a bossy mom?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.180
Listen, Minghua...

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.130
Hey, what are you—

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.060
Okay. Take off the blindfold.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.840
Minghua! Minghua!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:59.380
Now, I'm going to ask you a simple question.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.420
Who are you with?

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.880
Who sent you?

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.420
Where's Minghua?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.240
Where am I?

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.840
Start talking.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.720
I'm not a patient man.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:12.260
If you don't start talking, 
I'll shoot you right now.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.270
Th-This is some kind of mistake!

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.730
We were just going for a walk.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.570
That's a pretty lame excuse.

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:24.110
I guess intelligence agencies don't train 
their spies to handle interrogations anymore.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:25.770
Intelligence agencies?

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.590
Five seconds.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:30.350
I'll be pulling the trigger in five seconds.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:32.130
I'm not bluffing.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:33.030
Four!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.310
Wait!

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.290
Three!

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.530
You've got it all wrong!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.500
Two.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:38.360
I...

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.440
One!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:50.620
I knew you could move, you lazy ass.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:05.910
Fine, fine.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.080
I'll stop playing around.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:10.310
Hey, let's get this cleaned up.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.860
The princess is ticked off.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:21.710
I'm sorry.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:25.850
Narutani-kun, right?

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:28.980
Come with me.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.530
We've got something to talk about.

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.630
Minghua... Is she okay?

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.930
She's fine.

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.660
She's waiting at the guard post.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.120
She was worried enough about you 
to cause some serious damage.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.570
Is she your girlfriend?

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:44.010
It's not like that.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.070
I'll introduce myself.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:49.210
I'm with the Ministry of Defense Technical
 Research and Development Institute.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:52.970
My name's Director Yashirodoori, of the 
Special Technology Research Office.

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.630
Ministry of Defense?

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.860
You're with the JSDF?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:58.440
A technical officer, but yes.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:01.410
I mostly research how to fight the Xi.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:07.080
Do you know why the Xi defeat us so easily?

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.420
Because there are more of them,

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:12.540
and they have better fighters than we do?

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:14.630
That answer gets you a 30%.

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:18.530
Their numbers are part of it, 
but still, only part of the reason.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:22.540
What makes them a threat is 
their special abilities.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.770
HiMAT and EPCM.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.090
Hima... EP?

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:30.680
HiMAT. "Highly Maneuverable 
Aircraft Technology,"

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.200
which lets them move in ways 
manned fighters can't.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:38.230
Normally, the most a human fighter 
pilot can withstand is 9Gs.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:41.520
But the Xi can easily surpass that,

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.360
turning and accelerating at 
rates that humans simply can't.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:47.530
No normal fighter is a match for them.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:51.700
And let's say somebody did get 
within range and fired a missile.

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:55.840
It wouldn't hit. It would go 
off course and then explode.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.750
Even if you switched to 
manual and got close,

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:02.580
the closer you got to them, 
the harder they'd be to see.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:07.190
This is their other ability: EPCM.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:09.350
Electronic Perceptory Countermeasures.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:15.020
But we haven't just sat back and let this 
unknown super-technology run all over us.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.640
Adding HiMAT to existing fighter craft...

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.160
Adding Anti-EPCM capabilities...

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:23.310
Equipping special fighters with an autonomous
piloting device called "Anima,"

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.850
and tuning them to fight the Xi.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.480
We call these fighters "Daughters."

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.190
This is one of them.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:34.260
It's a Swedish fighter called the JAS39.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:35.710
The Gripen...

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:41.910
Correct. It's also the fighter that saved 
you during the evacuation of Shanghai.

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:45.450
We managed to get it in the 
air for its first flight,

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.100
but it's incredibly unstable.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:51.130
As you know, it had an ugly crash.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.520
But then what happened?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:57.470
Some boy came out of nowhere and 
started grabbing on to its canopy,

00:20:57.470 --> 00:21:00.530
and it suddenly restarted.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:06.290
And then today, we see that 
boy on our security cameras.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.200
So we put on a little show for it.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.320
It was enough to make it boot up.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:13.270
When it saw you...

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:15.400
I don't understand.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.690
Don't look at me. I don't know, either.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:24.390
But what I do know is that you 
being here stabilizes the Gripen.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:30.800
Allow me to introduce you again.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.350
This is the JAS39 Gripen.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:39.100
This is the fighter's autonomous 
piloting device, its "Anima."

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:42.340
I want you to make it so 
she can fly properly.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.580
Will you do it

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:49.090
for the sake of humanity's future,
 Prince Charming?

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.630
<b>Air Force Academy Handbook</b>

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.110
Next time on <i>Girly Air Force</i>...

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:33.060
ALT 02: "Komatsu Rendezvous."

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:40.010
<i>Komatsu Rendezvous</i>

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:37.360
Barbie 01, cleared for take off!
